<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-WSC Australia Sugar Weather.</title>
<headline>RTRS-WSC Australia Sugar Weather.</headline>
<text>
<p>As of 06:16 GMT, 30 OCT 1996</p>
<p>SUMMARY- Dry. Highs 79-82F (25-28C).</p>
<p>CROP IMPACT- A brief period of showers will not cause any major problems. More favorable conditions arrive late this week and this weekend.</p>
<p>FORECAST-</p>
<p>TODAY...Partly cloudy with a few isolated to scattered light showers, 25 percent coverage. Highs 78-84F (25-29C).</p>
<p>TONIGHT...A few light showers. Lows 60-72F (16-22C).</p>
<p>TOMORROW...Partly to variably cloudy with scattered showers of 0.10-0.50 inch (2-13mm). Highs 77-82F (24-28C).</p>
<p>OUTLOOK...Fair and turning warmer Friday-Sunday with a daily chance of isolated afternoon showers. Temperatures near to mostly above normal.</p>
<p>Source: Weather Services Corporation</p>
</text>
